+DLSS / FSR experimental 0.71
+============================
+
+UPDATE BOTH DOWNLOADS. Reinstall the compatibility patch with REPLACE and clear
+the shader cache. The 0.71 executables and the 0.71 patch must be used together:
+the patch's volumetric light shader reads a value only the 0.71 executables set.
+
+CHANGES FROM 0.7
+Image quality
+- Fixed fences, camouflage nets and similar see-through textures looking blocky
+  below native resolution while standing still. They were not jittered, so the
+  upscaler kept receiving the same samples. Other surfaces drawn by the same
+  shader are jittered now too.
+- Volumetric lights no longer shake after the upscaler. A little static remains.
+- Sharpening with DLSS Linear Input on was weaker on fine detail than with it off.
+  It is now corrected with an estimate, so the two are closer but not identical.
+- DLSS Linear Input (the HDR image for DLSS) no longer needs the post-processing
+  mode, so it also works with post-processing before the upscaler. Without that
+  mode it can make tree foliage behind depth of field shimmer at Performance and
+  below. Turn off DLSS Linear Input if you see this.
+
+Settings > Video > Basic: new Upscaling section
+All of these existed only as console commands in 0.7, or are new. Rows that do
+not apply to the current selection are hidden.
+- Post-processing after upscaling (r_upscaler_post_after). Needs a renderer
+  restart.
+- Sunshafts (r_upscaler_sunshafts): Upscaled, Smoothed or Raw. Default Smoothed.
+  Replaces r_upscaler_sunshaft_smooth, which no longer exists, so a value set
+  there in 0.7 is not carried over. With Combined sunshafts, Smoothed covers the
+  screen-space part only. Not listed for pure Volumetric sunshafts.
+- Full resolution particles (r_upscaler_particles_after, new). Off by default:
+  smoke, fire and dust go back before the upscaler, while laser beams stay after
+  it. On draws them after the upscaler, as 0.7 did. Compared on an RTX 4070: no
+  measurable FPS difference and no visible change on DLSS with Linear Input on.
+  With it off, FSR looks a bit grainier, and DLSS shows grid patterns on them
+  again if DLSS Linear Input is off, or on HDR10 output.
+- DLSS Linear Input (r_dlss_hdr_input). DLSS only. Needs a renderer restart.
+  On by default. Not used with HDR10 output or MSAA.
+
+Engine
+- Merged upstream Anomaly engine updates through 2026-11-02, including a fix for
+  a crash when a script reads a file list for a folder the game has not indexed.
+
+KNOWN ISSUES
+- FSR frame generation: lasers and red dot reticles leave two dim afterimages on
+  fast camera moves. DLSS-G and no frame generation are not affected.
+- Volumetric sunshafts keep some static after the upscaler, and Smoothed does
+  not cover them.
+- DLSS Linear Input with post-processing before the upscaler: tree foliage
+  shimmer behind depth of field at Performance and below, as described above.
+
